title: "Nocturnal humidity in subtropical Argentina, 1980–2025: analysis code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nesis
    given-names: Juan
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Buenos Aires, Argentina"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2439-3378"
abstract: >-
  Code that reproduces the analysis of warm-season nocturnal temperature, dew point and humidity trends at
  homogenized stations in subtropical Argentina, Paraguay and Uruguay (1980–2025), and their association with
  urban growth, agricultural intensification, circulation and vegetation.
